  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Girls to End Sexual Violence in South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will work in Limpopo and Gauteng Provinces to respond to the alarming rates of sexual violence in schools. The project will work promote the active role of girls as change agents and work with other stakeholders to develop a network of schools committed to zero tolerance to sexual violence and contribute to national initiatives and campaigns tackling the crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
